<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Fred Meyer cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Fred Meyer cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>- Dain Bosworth said it downgraded its rating on Fred Meyer Inc to a hold from a buy based strictly on price and increased earnings estimates to reflect recent real estate transactions by the general merchandise and home improvement retailer.</p>
<p>- Dain Bosworth analyst Gary Aster said he raised his earnings estimate for Fred Meyer for fiscal 1997 ending January 1998 to $2.55 a share from $2.35.</p>
<p>- Shares of Fred Meyer were trading off 5/8 to 36-3/4.</p>
<p>	   ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
</text>
